{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>asher</b> lo tzavah. One should not say: He did not command to bring strange fire, and also He did not command not to bring it. Rather, the meaning is: the command of 'lo' — He commanded them. And similarly: 'and to all the host of heaven, asher lo tzaviti' (which I did not command)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:19:03.986007687Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}